# Environment Configuration Template
# Phase 1: CNN/DailyMail Dataset Exploration
# No secret configuration or API keys are required for Phase 1.
# Classical NLP and local dataset exploration operate completely offline without external APIs.

# Future phases (FastAPI backend, MongoDB) may configure:
# MONGO_URI=mongodb://localhost:27017
# MONGO_DB_NAME=news_summarizer_db
# JWT_SECRET_KEY=change_me_in_future_phase
